clinfo @2010 Lupescu Grigore
CPU/GPU OpenCL basic information
			 
Command List
			 
			 CPU/GPU complete info:
			 ./clinfo 
			 
			 CPU info :
			 ./clinfo -cstd
			 ./clinfo -cinfo
			 ./clinfo -cvendor
			 ./clinfo -cgflops
			 ./clinfo -ccores
			 
			 GPU info :
			 ./clinfo -gstd
			 ./clinfo -ginfo
			 ./clinfo -gvendor
			 ./clinfo -ggflops
			 ./clinfo -gcores
